			"x": -560,
			"y": -40,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 400,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "0d265c01ce97bb9e",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Validate: the eight rules of Changes#Validation",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 120,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "626ce7220f912ddb",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Refuse: name the write and the rule",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 320,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 70,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "19b06b8e9500140c",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Write the change document\n`status: proposed`",
			"x": 360,
			"y": 120,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "e5227c384a340f29",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "design/Entities/Change Preview.md",
			"x": 720,
			"y": -40,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 400,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "c982ab5bd09eca6d",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**The user** reads the preview in the chat, or the change document in Obsidian, and may edit a proposed page",
			"x": 1220,
			"y": 100,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 120,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "4842e1559dd09fa8",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**reject**: status rejected, with the reason",
			"x": 1220,
			"y": 360,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 70,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "50dd5b8cffd72c72",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "apply: take the lock; commit a dirty tree as a snapshot",
			"x": 1640,
			"y": 110,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "2a0475d10c96612d",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Parse the document again and validate again",
			"x": 2000,
			"y": 120,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "a83d96a23290e740",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Does every base hash equal the file on disk?",
			"x": 2340,
			"y": 110,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "9d3820fec06edb63",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Conflict: name the path. The model reads it again and proposes a change that supersedes this one.",
			"x": 2340,
			"y": 330,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "12c9700cb1293b12",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Write the files; derive `updated`, `described`, and the harness settings",
			"x": 2680,
			"y": 110,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "7a9d72853d370a76",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "`status: applied`; one commit with the trailer `Atlas-Change`",
			"x": 3040,
			"y": 110,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "009992c12b4d31e7",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**PostToolUse** hook: the session gets the change; the change gets the session",
			"x": 3040,
			"y": -120,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "64e8cc31edd65a7c",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**undo**: find the commit by its trailer; refuse when a path changed since; restore from the parent; one `undo` commit",
			"x": 3480,
			"y": 90,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 150,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "5a382f92a4c61c0e",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Legend**\n\n- cyan: tool (code)\n- yellow: skill or agent (model)\n- purple: document or entity\n- green: hook (code, automatic)\n- orange: the user\n- red: a gate or a refusal",
			"x": -560,
			"y": -400,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 260
		}
	],
